://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)【3:1†source】\n- [Official Data API Docs](https://reactrouter.com/en/main/route/data)【3:3†source】\n- [npm react-router package](https://www.npmjs.com/package/react-router)【3:9†source】\n\nIf you want a specific demo or example repository for \"data-discover\" with React Router, let me know your use case for more targeted suggestions!",
